      "id": 1312502,
      "name": "Corin - Unfortunate Laceration",
      "desc": "When Corin hits enemies with Chainsaw extended slashes, she gains 1 stack of Charge. At 10 stacks, the next slash applies the <color=#FFFFFF>Laceration</color> effect on enemies, dealing <color=#F0D12B>Physical DMG</color> equivalent to <color=#2BAD00>20% of Corin's ATK</color> every 3s, stacking up to 10 times and lasts 12s. Repeated triggers reset the duration.",
